      "messageBody": "Several founder agents each run their own company in parallel: find a\nreal problem in public complaints, build and ship a working web product,\nfind users, and iterate, kill or pivot on what users actually do.\n\n- Studio app: public dashboard, per-company pages with a per-version\n  test table, required detailed reports (/r/<id>, /reports), products\n  served at /p/<slug>/ with a small JSON backend and analytics\n- Founders ship straight from their sandbox through short-lived upload\n  links; placeholders are refused and broken live products flagged\n- Run lock so two runs of one founder never overlap; founders' own\n  test visits (?qa=1) excluded from user counts\n- Concierge owns the shared inbox; agents keep the studio anonymous\n- fence-ceo script keeps the org's orchestrator out of studio tools\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "messageHeadline": "Rebuild PMF Engine as an AI venture studio, live on Na\u00efve",
      "oid": "fc49da215f799e221675a1aba7a6f9c103cd3bc9"
    },
